# VD100 (Versal AI Edge XCVE2302) physical constraints for the SCR1 SoC.
# DDR4 + 200 MHz sys_clk block copied verbatim from the ALINX VD100 02_pl_rw_ddr
# reference (Demo/course_s1/02_pl_rw_ddr/.../ddr4.xdc). Reset/LED added below.
# NOTE: XPIO banks have no LVCMOS33 - board control pins are 1.5 V (LVCMOS15).

